    "summary": "Spend 1 CP and 1–3 Pain tokens in any phase, right after a **HAEMONCULUS** model of yours is **destroyed**; it can be picked although it was just destroyed. When the phase ends, return it to the battlefield:\n\n- **unengaged**, as near as possible to the place it was destroyed\n- with 1 wound remaining per Pain token spent\n- outside any **attached unit**\n- in a unit whose **starting strength** is 1\n\nIt can't be used with 0 Pain tokens, and only once per battle on the same **HAEMONCULUS** model.",
